  "releaseNotes": "19.0.0\n* Existing PDF attachments are now preserved when saving a Factur-X document\n* Attachment descriptions are now preserved\n* New PdfUtils.AddAttachment() method to attach additional files to an existing PDF\n* Attachments are now merged from both /Names/EmbeddedFiles and /AF for more robust extraction",
